"""Echo Guard landing page (dark teal / mint).

Drop-in replacement for the existing landing_page_echo_guard_clean.py.

Integration contract (unchanged):
- Export LANDING_PAGE as HTML string.
- landing_routes.py replaces {{BASE_URL}} and {{COUNTER}}.
- Signup POSTs to /api/waitlist with name, phone, preference, children_count, children_ages.
- Serve the downloaded image at /og-guard-v2.png (this module does not embed it).

The preference dropdown is optional and posted as ``preference`` when selected.
"""
